Sorting: Time - O(1), Space - O(1)
    - Sort the meeting intervals based on their start time.
    - Iterate over the intervals and compare the start-time of current element and end time of previous element.
    - If (currentStartTime < previousEndTime) conflict exists, return false;
    - else If the meeting intervals null, empty or (currentStartTime > previousStartTime) for all interval, return true.